abstract: >-
  TruthLens combines TF-IDF + sentence-transformer + 17 stylometric features
  fed into a stacking ensemble (SVM + LR + RF + LR meta-learner), with a
  7-source RAG verification layer. It contributes three system-level integration
  novelties verified unpublished as of 2026-04-30: (1) a vocabulary-coverage
  abstention gate that ties selective prediction to TF-IDF dictionary overlap,
  (2) a bias-probe-driven debiasing loop with measurable before/after audit
  numbers, and (3) a structured ML-vs-RAG conflict explainer surfaced both in
  the API and the React UI.
